menuconfig RBOT_ENABLE_APP_HEARTBEAT_LOG
    bool "Enable periodic STATE heartbeat log"
    default n
    help
        Log "STATE: RUNNING" every 5 seconds. Enable only for debugging; disable in production to reduce
        log spam once AI/NET/heartbeat events are stable.

menuconfig RBOT_ENABLE_TOUCH_WAKE
    bool "Enable touch-triggered wakeword"
    default y
    help
        Treat a rising edge on the touch pin (GPIO0) as an artificial wakeword trigger.
        This simply calls board_wakeword_notify(1.0f) for debugging and does not change any
        GPIO mappings or pipeline behavior. Keep it disabled for production.
